  [ 3142.833517]  retire_submits+0x1a8/0x348
  [ 3142.833519]  retire_worker+0x14/0x20
  [ 3142.833521]  kthread_worker_fn+0xe0/0x2ec
  [ 3142.833583] INFO: task gpu-worker:584 is blocked on a mutex likely owned by task gnome-shell:5062.
  [ 3142.833588] task:gnome-shell     state:D stack:0     pid:5062  tgid:5062  ppid:4622   task_flags:0x400800 flags:0x00000018
